<view class="container px-4 py-4 space-y-4">

  <!-- 支持平台列表 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 mb-3">支持多平台无水印解析</view>
    <view class="platform-chips">
      <text class="chip">🎵 抖音 / TikTok</text>
      <text class="chip">⚡ 快手</text>
      <text class="chip">📕 小红书 (视频/图集)</text>
      <text class="chip">📺 哔哩哔哩 (B站)</text>
      <text class="chip">👁️ 微博 (视频/图文)</text>
      <text class="chip">📰 今日头条</text>
      <text class="chip">🦐 皮皮虾 / 皮皮搞笑</text>
      <text class="chip">🥤 汽水音乐</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 图文使用教程步骤 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4">📖 使用步骤教程</view>

    <view class="step-item mb-4 flex gap-3">
      <view class="step-number flex items-center justify-center">1</view>
      <view class="step-content">
        <view class="step-title">打开短视频 App 复制链接</view>
        <view class="step-desc">进入抖音、快手、小红书等 App，找到您喜欢的视频或图集，点击【分享】按钮，选择【复制链接】。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="step-item mb-4 flex gap-3">
      <view class="step-number flex items-center justify-center">2</view>
      <view class="step-content">
        <view class="step-title">打开本小程序一键粘贴</view>
        <view class="step-desc">打开小程序，首页会自动识别剪贴板链接，或直接点击【一键粘贴】按钮。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="step-item flex gap-3">
      <view class="step-number flex items-center justify-center">3</view>
      <view class="step-content">
        <view class="step-title">保存无水印视频到手机相册</view>
        <view class="step-desc">点击【开始提取】，成功解析后点击【保存无水印视频到相册】或【保存全部高清图集】即可完成下载！</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

</view>
